  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower into small florets. Slice red onion into thick wedges.\n• Place cauliflower and onion on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle over Mexican Fiesta spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and brown around edges, 20-25 minutes.\n• In the last 5 minutes of cook time, sprinkle over Cheddar cheese. Return to oven and roast until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3898ff8f6928425d5c6a6/step-ef615100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice tomato into wedges. Thinly slice Quke into rounds. Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• In a small bowl, combine the honey, mild chipotle sauce and garlic aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3898ff8f6928425d5c6a6/step-fc716410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine tomato, Qukes, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3898ff8f6928425d5c6a6/step-c7d5b520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Quke salad between bowls. Top with Mexican cheesy roasted cauliflower.\n• Drizzle over creamy chipotle dressing. Garnish with fresh chilli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e3898ff8f6928425d5c6a6/step-1fca7330.jpg"
    }
  ]
